    "body": "``` html\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<a ping=\"//[]     foo.html\">...</a>\n<script>\n//new URL(\"//[]\", location.href)\nw(document.body.firstChild.ping)\ndocument.body.firstChild.ping = \"foo.html\"\nw(document.body.firstChild.ping)\ndocument.body.firstChild.setAttribute(\"ping\", \"foo.html\")\nw(document.body.firstChild.ping)\n</script>\n```\n\nhttps://mxr.mozilla.org/mozilla-central/source/dom/html/nsGenericHTMLElement.cpp?rev=8d891ed31952#1778\n",
