    "created_at": "2016-01-26T08:55:56Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-01-26T08:55:56Z",
    "body": "Normalizing URLs in a DOMSettableTokenList sounds tedious, do we need that? The spec simply says that the `ping` attribute should be [reflected](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/infrastructure.html#reflect), and in the `DOMTokenList` section it doesn't say anything special.\n\nShould we add a note that no URL normalization happens, or how did it come about that Gecko added this?\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
    "reactions": {
      "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/whatwg/html/issues/comments/174903514/reactions",
      "total_count": 0,
      "+1": 0,
      "-1": 0,
