    "created_at": "2016-01-26T10:11:47Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-01-26T10:11:47Z",
    "body": "It was changed from `DOMString` to `DOMSettableTokenList` in commit a9d9256c74b9739f81d19eb041f84a91d99dcc40, but that doesn't really explain why the URL normalization would have been carried over in Gecko.\n\nIn any case, @Ms2ger, do you think it's fine to just leave this as other token lists?\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
