    "updated_at": "2016-01-26T11:33:54Z",
    "body": "`a.ping` is still `DOMString` in Gecko AFAICT. https://mxr.mozilla.org/mozilla-central/source/dom/webidl/HTMLAnchorElement.webidl#21\n\nThe part I quoted doesn't seem to be used for anything in the spec, AFAICT, so it should be dropped.\n",
