    "created_at": "2016-01-27T08:09:56Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-01-27T08:09:56Z",
    "body": "Oh, so it's a `DOMString` in Gecko too. IIRC, IE doesn't have it at all. Maybe we should change the spec to `DOMString` to save us some churn?\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
