    "updated_at": "2016-01-28T03:26:06Z",
    "body": "It seems like a complication of `DOMTokenList`, what would it do when you `add()` or call `contains()` with something that isn't an absolute URL, and the attribute value also doesn't contain absolute URLs? Resolve all strings before doing anything with them? Except not in `add()`, because you can get a non-absolute URL into the attribute with `setAttribute()` anyway?\n",
